config BK7258_APP_OTA
	bool "BK7258 paired OTA operator command"
	default n
	depends on BK7258_OTA && BK7258_OTA_RPMSG && SYSTEM_NSH
	select BUILTIN
	select NSH_BUILTIN_APPS
	---help---
		Build the trusted-maintainer bkota status/apply-file/cancel/confirm
		command.  File paths are forwarded to the AP OTA Manager; CP never opens
		the file and remains only the Pair Installer/Flash owner.  Manual confirm
		is a physical maintenance fallback; product profiles may enable the
		generation-bound CP automatic trial policy.

